{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"哥倫比亞有槍手闖入超市挾持多人\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/COL-HOSTAGE-261125-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】哥倫比亞有槍手闖入一間超市並挾持多名人質。</p><p>事件在北部城市卡塔赫納發生，當局派出多名警員到場，又出動直升機及狙擊手戒備。</p><p>哥倫比亞總統德拉埃斯普列亞表示，一批劫匪試圖截劫一架運鈔車事敗，之後逃入一間超市，並挾持多名員工及顧客。期間劫匪釋放了5人，但仍有25人被挾持。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.805059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:31:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:34.676128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:49.410748+00:00","content_hash":"0e24f1397c4bea0cc41822692740e5cb20580f5850de3da6edd200bee38f65f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}